        {
          "id": 3076823328,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Before changes to `.gitmessage`, `body` and `newbody` after  \n```\n        cmd = ['git', 'stripspace']\n        newbody = subprocess.check_output(cmd, input=body, universal_newlines=True)\n```\n\n```\ngit: output standards when message doesn't meet them\n\n\n\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n\n[\"git: output standards when message doesn't meet them\\n\", '\\n', '\\n', '\\n', '\\n', 'AI-Assisted: no\\n']\n\ngit: output standards when message doesn't meet them\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n\n[\"git: output standards when message doesn't meet them\\n\", '\\n', 'AI-Assisted: no\\n']\n```",
